<p>Kyle Lehman is a teacher and poet who loves to watch things grow like seeds, strange ideas, and the moon. He lives with his wife Claudia in Păltiniş, Romania and blogs about teaching at <a href="https://apearlineverycowslipsear.wordpress.com">https://apearlineverycowslipsear.wordpress.com</a>.</p>
